==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{m|non|drepa}}.

===Verb===
{{fo-verb|drap|drópu|dripið}}

# to [[kill]]
# to [[capture]] (''e.g. in chess'')
# to [[dip]]
# to [[move]]
# to get [[wet]]
# to [[drop]]

====Conjugation====
{{fo-conj-56|dr|e|p|i|a|ó}}

